<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan specialised insurance bond yield steady.</title>
<headline>Moldovan specialised insurance bond yield steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The yield on Moldovan 365-day specialised insurance bonds remained unchanged on Tuesday at 34.35 percent annual, a National Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>Full details of the 365-day insurance bonds auction:</p>
<p>				    Jan 14	   Dec 24</p>
<p>    Issue volume		2.00 million lei   2.50 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations	     1,000 lei	1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand	    5.96 million	 7.51 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold		 0.3 million	  2.50 million</p>
<p>    Yield			 34.35 pct	34.35 pct</p>
<p>    Price			 85.6 pct	 85.6 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids	     85.6-87.5 pct  85.6-88.0 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity		    Jan 16, 1998   Dec 26, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE: The yield includes a fixed annual income of 15 percent guaranteed by the Finance Ministry.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
